# XcodeGen output. project.pbxproj is generated from project.yml on every
# build and by CI, so committing it buys nothing and costs a conflict in
# every branch that adds a file — the diff carries no information the
# manifest does not already have. Run `xcodegen generate` after a checkout.
PRISM.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
